    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certifies that on 17th October 2006, the conversion of a garage to habitable room, as shown on drawing numbers 06.3586.P12 and 06.3586.P13, received 17th October 2006, was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:\r\nFollowing the conversion of the garage to a habitable room, the resulting building would fall within the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 1995, as there is no material change of use of part or whole of the building and therefore planning permission is not required.\r\n"
